146
00:09:14.309 --> 00:09:16.634
Valmistamine.

147
00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.880
Tule vaata kui vahva lõvi siin on.

148
00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:23.660
Ma arvan,
et see kindlasti erutaks alt.

149
00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.970
Kurailu kuulge, mis vahva nurk,
